[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13868.309, "timestamp": "03:51:08", "text": "日語。是的。  嗯哼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13875.67, "timestamp": "03:51:15", "text": "你們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13878.15, "timestamp": "03:51:18", "text": "平時都聽什麼類型的音樂？是這個嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13887.83, "timestamp": "03:51:27", "text": "呃，這個是 f，對吧？是這個嗎？這怎麼樣？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13907.429, "timestamp": "03:51:47", "text": "我打算買個皮膚。我已經在《衛報》"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13917.349, "timestamp": "03:51:57", "text": "上看到你了。要Valerent裡的皮膚，我會想要任何類型的刀具皮膚，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13919.83, "timestamp": "03:51:59", "text": "因為你不能隨便把你的刀送給別人，"}]